---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Results — LinksMaxing"
  description="Case studies showing the numbers that moved and the signals that pointed there."
  activeNav="results"
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-eyebrow">Results</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">The numbers <em>move.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Every case study shows the metric that moved, the intervention that moved it, and the signals in the data that said what to do.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="case-list">
    <a href="/results/case-study-01">
      <div class="case-card">
        <div class="case-meta">
          <div class="case-label">Case study 01</div>
          <div class="case-name">Residential cleaning</div>
          <div class="case-info">St. George, UT · 30-day sample</div>
          <div class="case-metric">
            <span class="was">0</span>
            <span class="arrow">→</span>
            <span>8</span>
          </div>
          <div class="case-metric-cap">of 12 ai queries named</div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <div class="case-headline">From invisible to named on <em>two out of three</em> queries in a month.</div>
          <div class="case-summary">Client had never been named by ChatGPT or Claude on the twelve queries a St. George homeowner would actually ask. We rebuilt the site on a crawler-native stack, fixed review schema hidden inside an iframe, and shipped service-area pages the assistants could retrieve.</div>
          <span class="case-link">Read the full study →</span>
          <div class="case-note">Illustrative sample. Real deltas publish as scans complete post-launch.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <div class="case-card" style="opacity:0.5;">
      <div class="case-meta">
        <div class="case-label">Case study 02</div>
        <div class="case-name">Fine dining</div>
        <div class="case-info">Dallas, TX · in progress</div>
        <div class="case-metric" style="color:var(--dim);">
          <span>—</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-metric-cap">baseline captured · scan pending</div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-body">
        <div class="case-headline">Contemporary American restaurant appearing in <em>zero</em> Dallas cuisine queries.</div>
        <div class="case-summary">Every dish, cocktail, and wine bottle lives inside PDFs invisible to AI assistants. The site wins one hyper-specific geographic query and disappears on every broader one. Rebuild in progress.</div>
        <span class="case-note">Study publishes after post-launch scan lands.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="cta-block">
    <h2 class="cta-head">See where <em>you stand.</em></h2>
    <p class="cta-sub">Every case study starts as a visibility check. Twenty minutes on a call, three to five days to run the scan.</p>
    <a href="/scan" class="btn">Book a visibility check →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .case-list {
    padding-top: clamp(32px, 6vh, 60px);
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .case-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px);
    padding: clamp(32px, 6vh, 56px) 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
    align-items: start;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }
  .case-card:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
  .case-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .case-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .case-info {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .case-metric {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px);
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--oxblood);
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .case-metric .was { color: var(--dimmer); }
  .case-metric .arrow { color: var(--dim); font-size: 0.55em; font-weight: 500; }
  .case-metric-cap {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dim);
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .case-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .case-headline em { color: var(--oxblood); font-style: normal; }
  .case-summary {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .case-link {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .case-note {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--dimmer);
    font-style: italic;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .case-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
</style>
